      "content": "yeah i get that. but is there a specific way to handle it if it starts making a hissing sound or if you see smoke? i've heard some people say these things can be really unpredictable and aggressive once they start to fail, like they have a mind of their own. what's the protocol for when it goes from just being swollen to being actively dangerous?",
